{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","一般攻击魔法"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","一般攻撃魔法"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对3格矩形范围的敌人造成大量伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","3マスの長方形範囲内の敵に大ダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","芙莉莲移动至尽可能最靠后的能覆盖最多敌人的位置，对3格矩形范围的敌人发射持续3秒的魔法攻击，每秒对范围内的敌人造成220% + 30% ATK伤害，并附带1400% + 180% ATK的真实伤害，真实伤害的部分由命中的所有敌人分摊。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","最も多くの敵を攻撃できる位置のうち、最も後ろのマスに移動し、3マスの長方形範囲内の敵に3秒間、魔法攻撃を行う。魔法攻撃は毎秒、範囲内の敵に220% + 30% ATKのダメージを与える。さらに、3秒間で合計1400% + 180% ATKの確定ダメージを与える。確定ダメージはヒットした敵全員に分配される"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":61,"end":67,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":82,"end":89,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":108,"end":115,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":57,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":103,"end":119,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每秒造成的伤害提升至240% + 30% ATK，附带的真实伤害提升至1500% + 180% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","毎秒ダメージが240% + 30% ATKにUPし、追加ダメージが1500% + 180% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":40,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":38,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":