s/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每秒造成的伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK，附带的真实伤害提升至1800% + 180% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","毎秒ダメージが300% + 30% ATKにUPし、追加ダメージが1800% + 180% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":40,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":38,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","破灭之雷魔法"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","破滅の雷を放つ魔法"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","在战斗开始时隐藏魔力，在一段时间后提升魔力输出并提升自己造成的伤害，随后使用“破灭之雷魔法”替代普通攻击，造成更高的伤害和控制效果。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時に魔力を隠し、一定時間後に自身の魔力出力が増加し、与ダメージUP。その後、通常攻撃が「破滅の雷を放つ魔法」に変化し、ダメージと行動阻害効果を追加"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，芙莉莲限制魔力，该状态下自己不会被敌人优先选为目标。在第15秒时，芙莉莲永久提升魔力输出，退出不被敌人优先选为目标的状态，使自身造成的伤害提升60%，并使用“破灭之雷魔法”替代普通攻击。“破灭之雷魔法”会对敌人造成3段220% + 25% ATK的伤害，最后一段伤害还会附带0.5秒的眩晕效果。在与辛美尔并肩作战5秒后，芙莉莲无视条件提升魔力输出，并且额外永久提升等同于辛美尔30%初始攻击力的攻击力。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、自身の魔力を制限する。魔力制限状態の間、敵に優先的に選択されない。戦闘開始から15秒後、自身の魔力出力が増加し、「敵に優先的に選択されない」状態を解除、与ダメージ+60%、通常攻撃が「破滅の雷を放つ魔法」に変化。「破滅の雷を放つ魔法」は敵に220% + 25% ATKのダメージを3回与え、3回目の攻撃でさらに0.5秒間のスタンを付与。出撃中の味方にヒンメルがいる、かつ5秒以上生存している場合、フリーレンはその時点で魔力出力が増加、さらに攻撃力が永続的に「ヒンメルの初期攻撃力×30%」分UP"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":119,"end":125,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":130,"end":136,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":115,"end":129,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":126,"end":140,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“破灭之雷魔法”每段对敌人造成的伤害提升至230% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「破滅の雷を放つ魔法」で敵に230% + 25% ATKのダメージを3回与える"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“破灭之雷魔法”每段对敌人造成的伤害提升至240% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「破滅の雷を放つ魔法」で敵に240% + 25% ATKのダメージを3回与える"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“破灭之雷魔法”每段对敌人造成的伤害提升至250% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「破滅の雷を放つ魔法」で敵に250% + 25% ATKのダメージを3回与える"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","地狱业火魔法"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","地獄の業火を出す魔法"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","使1格范围的敌人持续流失生命，并降低敌人的受愈。提升魔力输出后本技能释放频率提升。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","半径1マス以内にいる敵の治癒DOWN、持続的にHPが流失。魔力出力增加後、このスキルの発動頻度UP"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","芙莉莲释放“地狱业火魔法”，对半径1格范围内的所有敌人造成300% + 30% ATK伤害，并持续燃烧目标区域，持续5秒。燃烧期间，范围内的敌人每0.5秒流失35% ATK生命并降低20 + 5点受愈。在提升魔力输出后，本技能的冷却时间降低50%。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「地獄の業火を出す魔法」を発動し、半径1マス以内の敵全体に300% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、対象エリアは5秒間炎上する。炎上中、範囲内の敵は治癒-20 + 5、0.5秒ごとに35% ATKのHPが流失。魔力出力增加後、このスキルのCD-50%"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":93,"end":97,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":81,"end":85,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":79,"end":86,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":93,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“地狱业火魔法”使敌人降低的受愈提升至30 + 5点。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","炎上範囲内にいる敵の治癒減少量が30 + 5にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“地狱业火魔法”使敌人降低的受愈提升至40 + 5点。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","炎上範囲内にいる敵の治癒減少量が40 + 5にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“地狱业火魔法”使敌人降低的受愈提升至50 + 5点。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","炎上範囲内にいる敵の治癒減少量が50 + 5にUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升攻击力。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、攻撃力UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，芙莉莲提升9%攻击力，在提升魔力输出后额外提升6%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+9%。魔力出力增加後、追加で攻撃力+6%"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，芙莉莲提升12%攻击力，在提升魔力输出后额外提升8%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+12%。魔力出力增加後、追加で攻撃力+8%"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，芙莉莲提升15%攻击力，在提升魔力输出后额外提升10%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃力+15%。魔力出力增加後、追加で攻撃力+10%"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","防御魔法"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","防御魔法"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","使自身和最靠前一名友军降低所受到的伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身と最も前にいる味方1体の被ダメージDOWN"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，芙莉莲为自身和最靠前的一名友军施展防御魔法，当他们受到超过其10%初始最大生命值的伤害时，会使超出部分的伤害降低75%。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、自身と最も前にいる味方1体に防御魔法をかける。防御魔法をかけられた対象は、その初期HP上限×10%より高いダメージを受けた時、超過分の被ダメージ-75%"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","超出部分的伤害降低比例提升至80%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","超過分の被ダメージ軽減量が80%にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","最靠前的这名友军存活期间，芙莉莲额外提升35点急速。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","最も前にいる対象の味方の生存中、フリーレンの速度+35"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":0,"end":3,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":0,"end":6,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","超出部分的伤害降低比例提升至85%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","超過分の被ダメージ軽減量が85%にUP"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","击飞累积造成伤害最高的敌人并使其倒地。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","合計与ダメージが最も高い敵を打ち上げ、ノックダウンさせる"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","提升魔力输出后第5秒，芙莉莲将累积造成伤害最高的敌人击飞到战场边缘，对其造成800% ATK伤害并使其倒地，持续2秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","魔力出力が增加してから5秒後、合計与ダメージが最も高い敵をフィールドの端まで打ち上げ、800% ATKのダメージを与え、2秒間ノックダウンさせる"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":43,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","芙莉莲的法杖"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","フリーレンの杖"]]}